[[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Place the car on a ramp.</p><p><a href=\"#/2585221\">7055B54</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584236\">1048A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584206\">1032D12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584771\">4450B04</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584325\">1092B68</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584328\">1092C11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584331\">1092D10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584321\">1092A12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584194\">1032B14</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584583\">2110A60</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584198\">1032B47</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584172\">1020A30</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584290\">1084B28</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584307\">1088C14</a></p><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection for the engine oil pressure\nswitch.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Insufficient engine oil pressure (switch) sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">K30</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Undo and remove the engine oil filter.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2020894.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<p>1. Undo bolts (1a) and remove engine oil pump front cover (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2020895.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the crankshaft front cover to the engine\nblock.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Whenever the crankshaft front\ncover is removed, the underlying gasket must be replaced.</p></aside><p>Tighten the front cover retaining bolts\nto torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>CRANKSHAFT FRONT COVER</p></td><td><p>M6</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>(Crankcase) 1</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Screw in the engine oil filter by hand.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection for the\nengine oil pressure switch.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Insufficient engine oil pressure (switch) sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">K30</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/2584307\">1088C14</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584290\">1084B28</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584172\">1020A30</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584198\">1032B47</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584583\">2110A60</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584194\">1032B14</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584321\">1092A12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584331\">1092D10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584328\">1092C11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584325\">1092B68</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584771\">4450B04</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584206\">1032D12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584236\">1048A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584120\">0010T11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2585221\">7055B54</a></p><p>Remove the vehicle from the ramp.</p>"]]